      "imageUrl": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/E989-storage-ring-magnet-at-Fermilab-cr-Reidar-Hahn-Fermilab-Social.jpg",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/physicists-solve-a-muon-mystery-now-old-results-dont-add-up-20260729/",
