      "summary": "You've been invited by the happy couple, but they've asked for cash - not presents. North Londoners tell us what they would do.",
      "body": "Up Next. What you need to know if you're travelling to France or Spain. Video, 00:01:27SectionNewsPublished6 hours agoBBC speaks to Palestinians targeted by Israeli settlers. Video, 00:01:28SubsectionMiddle EastPublished1 day agoWatch: At the scene of Berlin Pride attack as manhunt continues. Video, 00:01:27SubsectionEuropePublished1 day agoAndy Burnham rules out early election in exclusive BBC interview. Video, 00:01:22SubsectionPoliticsPublished1 day agoWatch: Protesters celebrate resignation of India's education minister. Video, 00:01:17SubsectionAsiaPublished2 days agoEastern Rosellas! - Meet the seven-year-old behind viral song. Video, 00:00:55SubsectionAustraliaPublished2 days ago'Security was tighter this time': Inside the room at Trump press dinner. Video, 00:00:56SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days ago'Upheaval' - French wildfire evacuations in the middle of the night. Video, 00:01:09SubsectionEuropePublished2 days agoIndia cockroach protests: Videos show officers firing 'pellet guns' Video, 00:02:01SubsectionAsiaPublished3 days agoWatch: Another day, more Trump tariffs - but are they working? Video, 00:01:37SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished3 days agoWatch: Wildfires rage across Spain and France. Video, 00:01:04SubsectionEuropePublished3 days ago",
